<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">VortexPIA</span>: Indirect Prompt Injection Attack against LLMs for 
<br class="ltx_break">Efficient Extraction of User Privacy</h1>
